<title>JAPAN: Japan's IBJ says cuts its prime rate to 2.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Japan's IBJ says cuts its prime rate to 2.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Industrial Bank of Japan Ltd (IBJ) said on Monday it would cut its long-term prime rate by 0.3 percentage point to 2.7 percent, effective from Wednesday.</p>
</text>
